From 2d66597d1f3fbedd40bb2fe01867057f3954a33e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nobara Project <nobara@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:22:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] remotedesktop: implement RemoteDesktop portal with wlroots
 virtual input

Implement org.freedesktop.impl.portal.RemoteDesktop using
zwlr_virtual_pointer_manager_v1 and zwp_virtual_keyboard_manager_v1.
Remote desktop sessions reuse the ScreenCast stream selection, so
clients such as RustDesk can capture and control wlroots compositors.
